c(53, "§0.1 (invisible to Apple); §0.7; §8.8", "anti-pattern", "Billing outside the App Store detaches the money from every consumer safeguard the platform provides — the charge cannot be cancelled in iOS Settings, Apple cannot refund it, it does not appear in an auditable purchase history, and it is invisible to the review-and-ratings context where the app shows 4.1★; users escalate to the only levers left (bank statements, blocked cards, chargebacks, FTC/FCC/BBB/trading standards) and the listing accumulates 67 warning reviews (38.29%) that become the conversion gate ('I wish I read the reviews first').", "off-store subscription", "1★-burst", "RAIL_NOT_IN_APPLE 13; BLOCKED_CARD 7; ESCALATED 16; WARN_OTHERS 67; CHECKED_REVIEWS 12", "dont", "High-priority", "generalisable", ["12822274987", "12715520806", "12219957634", "12329827913"], "", "")

